title: Blockchain read from a page with no wallet (EtherHiding)
severity: high
score: 55
tags: etherhiding, web3
attack: T1102.001, T1105, T1189
description: A page that is not a wallet/web3 app (no wallet UI, no wallet use) read a smart
  contract over JSON-RPC (eth_call / eth_getStorageAt). This is the EtherHiding dead- drop
  loader pattern. The rule fires on allowlisted sites too, because EtherHiding runs on
  compromised legitimate sites.
